  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> Can_GetControllerTxErrorCounter (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> ControllerId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* Tx Error CounterPtr);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Returns the Tx error counter for a CAN controller. This value might not be available for all CAN controllers, in which case E_ NOT_ OK would be returned. Please note that the value of the counter might not be correct at the moment the API returns it, because the Tx counter is handled asynchronously in hardware. Applications should not trust this value for any assumption about the current bus state.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00233\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Can_Write <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00233\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00233]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00233\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00233, S. 73)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> Can_Write (Can_HwHandleType Hth, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Can_00415\">Can_PduType</a>* PduInfo);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This function is called by Can If to pass a CAN message to Can Drv for transmission.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00443\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> <LPDU_CalloutName> <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00443\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00443]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00443\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00443, S. 84)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> <<<<<LPDU_CalloutName>>>>> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Hrh, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"#SWS_Can_00416\">Can_IdType</a> CanId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Can Data Legth, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* Can SduPtr);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>-</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00225\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Can_MainFunction_Write <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00225\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00225]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00225\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00225, S. 85)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Can_MainFunction_Write (void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This function performs the polling of TX confirmation when CAN_ TX_ PROCESSING is set to POLLING.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00226\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Can_MainFunction_Read <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00226\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00226]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00226\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00226, S. 86)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Can_MainFunction_Read (void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This function performs the polling of RX indications when CAN_ RX_ PROCESSING is set to POLLING.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00227\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Can_MainFunction_BusOff <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00227\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00227]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00227\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00227)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Can_MainFunction_BusOff (void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This function performs the polling of bus - off events that are configured statically as 'to be polled'.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00228\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Can_MainFunction_Wakeup <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00228\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00228]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00228\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00228, S. 79)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Can_MainFunction_Wakeup (void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This function performs the polling of wake - up events that are configured statically as 'to be polled'.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00368\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> Can_MainFunction_Mode <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00368\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00368]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00368\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00368)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">void Can_MainFunction_Mode (void);</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This function performs the polling of CAN controller mode transitions.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00413\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_ConfigType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00413\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00413]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00413\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00413)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This is the type of the external data structure containing the overall initialization data for the CAN driver and SFR settings affecting all controllers. Furthermore it contains pointers to controller configuration structures. The contents of the initializ ation data structure are CAN hardware specific.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00415\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_PduType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00415\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00415]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00415\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00415, S. 55)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type unites Pdu Id (sw Pdu Handle), Sdu Length (length), Sdu Data (sdu), and Can Id (id) for any CAN L - SDU.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00416\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_IdType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00416\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00416]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00416\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00416)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Represents the Identifier of an L - PDU. The two most significant bits specify the frame type: 00 CAN message with Standard CAN ID 01 CAN FD frame with Standard CAN ID 10 CAN message with Extended CAN ID 11 CAN FD frame with Extended CAN ID</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_00429\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_HwHandleType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_00429\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_00429]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_00429\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_00429, S. 56)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Represents the hardware object handles of a CAN hardware unit. For CAN hardware units with more than 255 HW objects use extended range.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_CAN_00496\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_HwType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_CAN_00496\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_CAN_00496]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CAN_00496\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_CAN_00496)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>This type defines a data structure which clearly provides an Hardware Object Handle including its corresponding CAN Controller and therefore Can Drv as well as the specific Can Id.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_91003\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_ErrorStateType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_91003\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_91003]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_91003\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_91003, S. 57)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Error states of a CAN controller.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_91013\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_ControllerStateType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_91013\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_91013]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_91013\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_91013, S. 58)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>States that are used by the several Controller Mode functions.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\" id=\"SWS_Can_91021\"><span class=\"kind\">type</span> Can_ErrorType <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"../../versions.html?id=SWS_Can_91021\" title=\"Requirement im Versions- &amp; Revisions-Explorer anzeigen\">[SWS_Can_91021]</a></span> <a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R20-11/CP/AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf#nameddest=SWS_Can_91021\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"sws-pdf-link\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF im Original öffnen: AUTOSAR_SWS_CANDriver.pdf (Anker: #SWS_Can_91021, S. 59)\">📄 PDF</a></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The enumeration represents a superset of CAN Error Types which typical CAN HW is able to report. That means not all CAN HW will be able to support the complete set.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  }
 ]
}
